<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen highlights Baan.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen highlights Baan.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen and Co said it named Baan Co NV its &quot;software stock of the month.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Dutch company were up 1-7/8 to 39-1/8 in Nasdaq trading.</p>
